# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `build/` matches a directory of
# that name ANYWHERE — which is how app/api/workspace/build/route.ts was
# silently untracked from the day it was written: `git add -A` skipped it, the
# file only ever existed on one machine, and every deploy answered that route
# with an HTML 404. The AI workspace builder had never worked in production.
